# Comprehensive benchmark exercising the complete Adelia color management library.
# Stress-tests color space structs (RGB, HSL, HSV, CMYK), all fourteen
# ColorConverter conversion methods, the Color class API surface, perceptual
# distance computation, seven palette generation algorithms, web-safe snapping,
# CSS and ANSI terminal formatting, and the 140+ entry color name database.
